  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "leadership-challenge-s012-p01094",
      "source_en": "1. Maintain high expectations about what individuals and teams can accomplish. 2. Communicate your positive expectations clearly and regularly. 3. Create an environment that makes it comfortable to receive and give feedback. 4. Find out the types of encouragement that make the most difference. Don't assume you know. Ask. Take the time to inquire and observe. 5. Be creative when it comes to recognition. Be spontaneous. Have fun. 6. Make saying “thank you” a natural part of your everyday behavior.",
